{
    "title": "Craftsman Building Sim Games",
    "description": "If you are someone who likes the art of building, building houses, castles, or residential and rural environments with the architectural support available in this game, then you have to download Craftsman Building Sim Games, because this game provides what you are looking for, equipped with various farm animals. and production plants.\r\n\r\nThis Craftsman Building Sim Games presents beautiful graphics with more realistic natural sounds, natural animal sounds, such as the sound of birds, the buzzing of flying bees, the sounds of cats, dogs, goats, the sound of cows mooing which will be present in the world you create.\r\nEquipped with the sound of running water, the sound of your footsteps through grass, rocks and water. In this game you can activate flight mode by 2 quick taps on the round button on the right side of your game screen.\r\nThis game is very easy to play with several types of modern or rural housing environments, ancient medieval housing, equipped with the activities of the residents who inhabit that environment.\r\nCreate your own home in the style you want, furnish it with the furniture you have in stock.\r\n\r\nYou will find the beauty of the world in this game like the real world, various low plants and trees grow in different environments, you can explore it, explore various kinds of forests, with all the animals appearing in them, fight and adventure against monsters that will suddenly appear in around you.\r\n\r\nThis Craftsman Building Sim Games provides a variety of blocks, items and complete building equipment to build a city, by complementing the buildings that already exist in this game. There are many materials available in this game, blocks in the form of metal, such as iron, copper, bronze, gold and there are also several precious stones such as diamonds. You can also build a train track with a fast cart feature for the train or roller coaster that you make, the train speed is easily configured to increase and apply braking on the rail when the cart is moving, with a controlled start-stop rail function, and a detector rail which sends a signal when a train passes over it. The rails in this game also have a rail crossing switching feature with a running button to the right or left equipped with a handbrake with a tap button, really a complete simulator game for a game with a small file size and you can play it offline.\r\n\r\nThis game is played in creative mode and can be played offline. For furniture needs, we provide various furniture and electronics in this Craftsman Building Sim Games, there are many colors available so you can adjust the room design and the color of the furniture you want to use. With this special mod for functional furniture, you can watch anything from a working TV to working kitchen appliances. Now when you come home from work you can relax on a nice, comfortable sofa with good lighting from decorative lamps in your room.",
    "descriptionHTML": "If you are someone who likes the art of building, building houses, castles, or residential and rural environments with the architectural support available in this game, then you have to download Craftsman Building Sim Games, because this game provides what you are looking for, equipped with various farm animals. and production plants.<br><br>This Craftsman Building Sim Games presents beautiful graphics with more realistic natural sounds, natural animal sounds, such as the sound of birds, the buzzing of flying bees, the sounds of cats, dogs, goats, the sound of cows mooing which will be present in the world you create.<br>Equipped with the sound of running water, the sound of your footsteps through grass, rocks and water. In this game you can activate flight mode by 2 quick taps on the round button on the right side of your game screen.<br>This game is very easy to play with several types of modern or rural housing environments, ancient medieval housing, equipped with the activities of the residents who inhabit that environment.<br>Create your own home in the style you want, furnish it with the furniture you have in stock.<br><br>You will find the beauty of the world in this game like the real world, various low plants and trees grow in different environments, you can explore it, explore various kinds of forests, with all the animals appearing in them, fight and adventure against monsters that will suddenly appear in around you.<br><br>This Craftsman Building Sim Games provides a variety of blocks, items and complete building equipment to build a city, by complementing the buildings that already exist in this game. There are many materials available in this game, blocks in the form of metal, such as iron, copper, bronze, gold and there are also several precious stones such as diamonds. You can also build a train track with a fast cart feature for the train or roller coaster that you make, the train speed is easily configured to increase and apply braking on the rail when the cart is moving, with a controlled start-stop rail function, and a detector rail which sends a signal when a train passes over it. The rails in this game also have a rail crossing switching feature with a running button to the right or left equipped with a handbrake with a tap button, really a complete simulator game for a game with a small file size and you can play it offline.<br><br>This game is played in creative mode and can be played offline. For furniture needs, we provide various furniture and electronics in this Craftsman Building Sim Games, there are many colors available so you can adjust the room design and the color of the furniture you want to use. With this special mod for functional furniture, you can watch anything from a working TV to working kitchen appliances. Now when you come home from work you can relax on a nice, comfortable sofa with good lighting from decorative lamps in your room.",
